# Sheets-parity cell edit (PLAN / LOG grid)

Do **not** implement a spreadsheet. Do **not** add Handsontable, AG Grid, Luckysheet, Univer, FullCalendar, or any grid library. Reimplement the keyboard + in-cell string behavior on the existing `EditablePerformanceCell` instances.

This rule **overrides** `design.md` §11.4 where they conflict (today §11.4 documents click-opens-edit and ArrowUp/Down commit-while-editing). Patch §11.4 in the implementation PR to match this subset. Canonical training values stay **numeric** (`architecture.md`, `numericTraining.ts`); Google Sheets remains **one-way publish**, not this grid (`architecture.md` §14).

Screenshot of the surface: session table with set #, **PLAN kg × reps @ RPE**, copy-plan→log, **LOG kg × reps @ RPE**, Δ, e1RM, INOL, duplicate/delete.

