## Keep / drop

| Behavior | Verdict | Rationale |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Click = select; double-click / F2 / Enter / printable = start edit | **Keep** | Core Sheets nav. Current click-to-edit is the main mismatch |
| Esc cancel; Enter commit + down **when editing**; Tab commit + right; Shift reverses | **Keep** | Sheets + Handsontable editor context |
| Enter / F2 **from selected** = begin insert-edit (not move) | **Keep** | Sheets / Handsontable (Excel Enter-from-selected = move is **dropped**) |
| Arrows move cell when selected | **Keep** | |
| Arrows move caret when editing, **including at edges** | **Keep** | Sheets-accurate. Drop Excel edge-escape and drop current ArrowUp/Down commit |
| Delete/Backspace clear when selected; edit string when editing | **Keep** | |
| F2 begin edit; while editing F2 is no-op (no formula range mode) | **Keep** | No formulas in this grid |
| Home/End in selected = first/last cell of the **row**; in edit = caret | **Keep** | Cheap; 6-col row |
| Ctrl/Cmd+Arrow to row/col end | **Drop** | Tiny grid; Home/End enough |
| Shift+arrows **range** select | **Drop** | This grid has no range. Shift+arrows in **edit** still select **text** |
| Copy/paste **TSV** / fill / Ctrl+D / Ctrl+R | **Drop** | Not in this checkout. Session copy stays `copyClipboard.ts` |
| Single-cell Ctrl/Cmd+C / V in **selected** mode | **Keep** | Sheets copies the active cell; without this, selected mode copies nothing |
| Page Up/Down, Ctrl+Home/End sheet jump, freeze, new sheet | **Drop** | |
| Formulas, `=`, autocomplete, data validation UI | **Drop** | Structured fields only |
| IME composition guard | **Keep** | Required for 1:1 string input |
| Mobile quick-adjuster sheet | **Keep** | `design.md` §11.4; do not Sheets-ify touch |
| `50ms` `setTimeout` + `.click()` nav | **Drop** | Race; replace with focus on the address |
| Handsontable / AG Grid / Univer / Luckysheet / FullCalendar as deps | **Drop** | Forbidden. Steal **ideas** only |
| Auto-seed demo sets | **Drop** | Empty plans stay empty |

